Money: every form its examples take (area 19, "Changing a standard type's encoding")
encoding 1
column amount bigint
column currency char(3)

example GBP -5.00
text GBP -5.00
json {"amount":-500,"currency":"GBP"}
stored amount -500
stored currency 'GBP'

